    },
    "body": "**Problem:** `createrawtransaction` accepts a JSON number as `data` when its digits form valid hex. For example, it treats `99` as the string `\"99\"` and writes the byte `0x99` to the output.\n\n**Fix:** Pass the original JSON value to the hex parser so it can enforce the documented string type.\n",
